	# Zone 3: Continuous Bottom Ground on B.Cu
	# Keeps X in [28.50, 31.50] clear between Y=18.0 and Y=25.0 around J1 Pin 1,
	# and bridges solidly across X in [10.50, 54.50] for Y in [25.00, 44.50].
	
)
